•	Family size
•	Is-alone flag
•	Ticket frequency
•	Ticket-group-based aggregated statistics
•	Interaction features (Sex × Class, Fare × Class)
•	Polynomial features (controlled)
•	Aggregation features (group-level)
•	Domain-informed features
