13. Categorical Encoding
•	Rare category grouping
•	Label encoding
•	One-hot encoding
•	Ordinal encoding (Pclass)
•	Frequency encoding
•	Target encoding with CV-safety
•	Hashing and collision analysis
•	Fold-stability checks for encodings
