14. Feature Selection and Dimensionality Reduction
•	Variance thresholding
•	Correlation-based pruning
•	Univariate statistical tests
•	Mutual information
•	Model-based importance rankings
•	Recursive feature elimination
•	PCA for dimensionality exploration
•	Stability across cross-validation folds
________________________________________
15. Consistency and Validation
•	Schema validation (post-transform)
•	Type coercion checks
•	Range checks
•	Cross-field consistency (Family size vs SibSp + Parch)
•	Constraint enforcement
________________________________________
16. Dataset Splitting and Preparation
•	Train/validation split
•	Stratified splitting
•	Cross-validation folds
•	Group-aware CV using Ticket groups
•	Leakage prevention checks
•	Pipeline freezing and reproducibility
________________________________________
17. Modeling and Evaluation
•	Dummy classifier baseline
•	Logistic regression
•	Decision trees
•	Random forests
•	Gradient boosting models
•	Performance metrics: 
o	Accuracy
o	F1
o	ROC-AUC
•	Confusion matrix analysis
•	Calibration checks
•	Subgroup-level error analysis
•	Feature importance interpretation
•	SHAP-based interpretation
________________________________________
18. Pipeline Robustness
•	Train pipeline with shuffled columns
•	Train pipeline with missing columns
•	Handle unseen categories at inference
•	Inference-time schema enforcement
•	Fail-fast validation rules
•	Idempotency tests
________________________________________
19. Fairness Diagnostics
•	Survival rate comparison across demographic groups
•	Proxy bias detection
•	Fairness metrics (demographic parity difference, etc.)
•	Tradeoff visualization between fairness and accuracy

